<title>USA: Waverly Inc Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Waverly Inc Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BALTIMORE 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands of dollars - except per share amounts)</p>
